[
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "hook",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Matching said: put the cost with the revenue it helps to earn. A machine helps to earn revenue for years. So its cost is not an expense on the purchase day. Depreciation is matching, stretched across useful life.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\hook.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "define",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Depreciation allocates the depreciable cost of a long-lived asset across its useful life. It is an estimate, not a cash payment and not a market price.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\define.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "example",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "A printer costs five units and should last five years with no residual. Cash leaves now. Expense is one unit a year. Year one profit is not punished for the whole machine.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\example.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "formula",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Depreciation is not a valuation guess. It allocates a prepaid bundle of machine-years across the periods that use them.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\formula.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "van",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Pay 100 for a van. Expect 10 at the end. Five years of work sit in between. Straight line puts 18 of expense in each of those years.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\van.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "steps",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Subtract what you expect to recover. Divide by the years of use. Put that slice in the period. Market price next year is a different question.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\steps.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "life",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "The useful life is the clock. If the van works five years, five periods share the net cost. Do not dump the 100 into year one.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\life.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "views",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Dumping the whole cost in year one hides later work. Ignoring residual overstates expense. Rewriting life every month turns a rule into a mood.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\views.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "takeaway",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Paying for an asset and using an asset are different events. Depreciation records the use. That closes this sitting: we now know which period gets the sale, the matching cost, and the machine.",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\en\\takeaway.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "hook",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "配比说：成本和它所帮助赚到的收入放在一起。机器会帮好几年的忙。所以购买日不能把全部成本一次记成费用。折旧就是把配比拉长到使用年限。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\hook.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "define",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "折旧把长期资产的应折旧成本分摊到使用寿命各期。它是估计，不是付现，也不是市价。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\define.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "example",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "打印机花五单位，预计用五年且无残值。现金现在就出去。费用是每年一单位。第一年利润不必承担整台机器。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\example.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "formula",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "折旧不是估值猜测。它把预付的一捆机器年，分到真正使用这些年的期间。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\formula.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "van",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "花100买货车。预计最后剩10。中间有五年工作。直线法每年记18的费用。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\van.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "steps",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "减去预计收回的部分。再除以使用年数。把这一片记入当期。明年市价是另一个问题。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\steps.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "life",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "使用年限就是时钟。货车用五年，就由五个期间分担净成本。不要把100全部丢进第一年。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\life.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "views",
    "language": "zh_cn",
    "text": "第一年吃掉全部成本，会藏起后面的工作。忽略残值会夸大费用。每月改年限会把规则变成心情。",
    "dest_path": "C:\\Users\\kochi\\Dropbox\\video-factory\\out\\ACC-DP-01\\audio\\zh_cn\\views.mp3",
    "with_timestamps": true
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "ACC-DP-01",
    "beat_id": "takeaway",
